{"page":17,"width":1912,"height":2883,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"1.2 컴퓨터 시스템의 구성","words":[{"text":"1.2","x":1254,"y":174,"width":52,"height":25},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1325,"y":174,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"시스템의","x":1408,"y":173,"width":99,"height":28},{"text":"구성","x":1517,"y":173,"width":50,"height":29}]},{"text":"저장장자 정의와 표기","words":[{"text":"저장장자","x":824,"y":361,"width":141,"height":41},{"text":"정의와","x":978,"y":359,"width":107,"height":42},{"text":"표기","x":1093,"y":358,"width":71,"height":41}]},{"text":"13","words":[{"text":"13","x":1647,"y":168,"width":40,"height":30}]},{"text":"컴퓨터 저장장치의 기본단위는 비트이다. 한 비트는 0과 1 두 값 중 하나를 가진","words":[{"text":"컴퓨터","x":355,"y":449,"width":99,"height":41},{"text":"저장장치의","x":474,"y":449,"width":168,"height":40},{"text":"기본단위는","x":662,"y":449,"width":174,"height":40},{"text":"비트이다.","x":854,"y":449,"width":146,"height":40},{"text":"한","x":1017,"y":448,"width":38,"height":39},{"text":"비트는","x":1071,"y":447,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"0과","x":1189,"y":446,"width":57,"height":40},{"text":"1","x":1262,"y":449,"width":16,"height":32},{"text":"두","x":1297,"y":447,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"값","x":1349,"y":445,"width":38,"height":40},{"text":"중","x":1399,"y":447,"width":38,"height":38},{"text":"하나를","x":1453,"y":445,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"가진","x":1577,"y":444,"width":71,"height":40}]},{"text":"다. 컴퓨터의 모든 다른 저장장치는 비트의 집합을 기반으로 한다. 비트의 길이가","words":[{"text":"다.","x":353,"y":514,"width":41,"height":40},{"text":"컴퓨터의","x":415,"y":514,"width":133,"height":41},{"text":"모든","x":565,"y":516,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":651,"y":514,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"저장장치는","x":736,"y":514,"width":174,"height":40},{"text":"비트의","x":927,"y":514,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"집합을","x":1047,"y":512,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"기반으로","x":1167,"y":512,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":1320,"y":511,"width":80,"height":41},{"text":"비트의","x":1420,"y":511,"width":102,"height":41},{"text":"길이가","x":1544,"y":510,"width":107,"height":40}]},{"text":"충분히 긴 경우 컴퓨터는 놀랍게도 다양한 것들을 표현할 수 있다. 몇 개 예를 든다","words":[{"text":"충분히","x":351,"y":579,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"긴","x":470,"y":579,"width":31,"height":39},{"text":"경우","x":518,"y":579,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"컴퓨터는","x":600,"y":579,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"놀랍게도","x":748,"y":578,"width":141,"height":41},{"text":"다양한","x":902,"y":579,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"것들을","x":1021,"y":578,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"표현할","x":1136,"y":578,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1253,"y":577,"width":37,"height":41},{"text":"있다.","x":1304,"y":577,"width":80,"height":40},{"text":"몇","x":1397,"y":578,"width":32,"height":39},{"text":"개","x":1446,"y":577,"width":31,"height":41},{"text":"예를","x":1495,"y":577,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"든다","x":1578,"y":576,"width":74,"height":40}]},{"text":"면 숫자, 글자, 영상, 영화, 소리, 문서 그리고 프로그램 등이다. 한 바이트는 8비트","words":[{"text":"면","x":354,"y":644,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"숫자,","x":399,"y":644,"width":80,"height":41},{"text":"글자,","x":493,"y":642,"width":78,"height":43},{"text":"영상,","x":588,"y":644,"width":77,"height":41},{"text":"영화,","x":681,"y":644,"width":77,"height":41},{"text":"소리,","x":772,"y":645,"width":78,"height":40},{"text":"문서","x":865,"y":645,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"그리고","x":949,"y":645,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"프로그램","x":1067,"y":643,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"등이다.","x":1220,"y":642,"width":114,"height":41},{"text":"한","x":1350,"y":643,"width":37,"height":39},{"text":"바이트는","x":1400,"y":644,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"8비트","x":1558,"y":642,"width":94,"height":40}]},{"text":"이고 대부분의 컴퓨터에서는 가장 작은 편리한 저장 단위이다. 예를 들면 대부쁜의","words":[{"text":"이고","x":353,"y":709,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"대부분의","x":435,"y":710,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"컴퓨터에서는","x":588,"y":710,"width":208,"height":40},{"text":"가장","x":808,"y":710,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"작은","x":890,"y":710,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"편리한","x":975,"y":710,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"저장","x":1092,"y":709,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"단위이다.","x":1173,"y":709,"width":149,"height":40},{"text":"예를","x":1339,"y":709,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"들면","x":1421,"y":709,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"대부쁜의","x":1508,"y":709,"width":140,"height":41}]},{"text":"컴퓨터들은 하나의 비트를 이동하는 명령어는 제공하지 않지만 한 바이트를 이동","words":[{"text":"컴퓨터들은","x":352,"y":774,"width":174,"height":40},{"text":"하나의","x":541,"y":776,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"비트를","x":661,"y":775,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"이동하는","x":782,"y":775,"width":139,"height":41},{"text":"명령어는","x":939,"y":776,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"제공하지","x":1093,"y":775,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"않지만","x":1248,"y":774,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"한","x":1368,"y":775,"width":38,"height":38},{"text":"바이트를","x":1420,"y":774,"width":145,"height":41},{"text":"이동","x":1582,"y":775,"width":71,"height":40}]},{"text":"하는 명령어는 제공한다. 약간 덜 알려진 용어가 워드이다. 워드는 그 컴퓨터 구조","words":[{"text":"하는","x":350,"y":841,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"명령어는","x":435,"y":840,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"제공한다.","x":588,"y":841,"width":146,"height":40},{"text":"약간","x":752,"y":841,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"덜","x":836,"y":842,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"알려진","x":886,"y":840,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"용어가","x":1003,"y":840,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"워드이다.","x":1124,"y":840,"width":146,"height":40},{"text":"워드는","x":1288,"y":841,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":1408,"y":846,"width":37,"height":27},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1461,"y":841,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"구조","x":1580,"y":843,"width":73,"height":38}]},{"text":"의 본연의 데이터 단위이다. 한 워드는 하나 이상의 바이트로 구성된다. 예를 들면","words":[{"text":"의","x":350,"y":906,"width":30,"height":40},{"text":"본연의","x":397,"y":906,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"데이터","x":518,"y":906,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"단위이다.","x":635,"y":906,"width":148,"height":40},{"text":"한","x":800,"y":906,"width":36,"height"